Derived files and adaptations:
- geometry.ts: Vector snapping, polyline and rectangle hit testing, segment resizing, and clipping adapted from Satty's src/math.rs and src/tools/mod.rs.
- types.ts & document.ts: Object-level history entry model (Replace, Remove, UpdateIndex, ClearAll) and drawing tool primitives adapted from Satty's src/femtovg_area/imp.rs and tool definitions.
- renderer.ts: Canvas-based rendering, arrow head projection, and pixelation block rasterization adapted from Satty's src/tools/arrow.rs and src/tools/pixelate.rs.
